#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Minitron-8B-Base.md:108
msgid ""
"`Minitron-8B-Base` can be deployed through `vllm-ascend` for online "
"inference and benchmark evaluation.   Actual throughput and latency depend "
"on hardware resources, prompt length, output length, concurrency, and "
"runtime configuration."
msgstr ""
"`Minitron-8B-Base` 可通过 `vllm-ascend` "
"部署以进行在线推理和基准评估。实际吞吐量和延迟取决于硬件资源、提示词长度、输出长度、并发数以及运行时配置。"

